      <title>Customer Journey Map Template</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Jun 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/</guid>
      <description>\[siteorigin\_widget class=&#34;SiteOrigin\_Widget\_Headline\_Widget&#34;\]\[/siteorigin\_widget\]\[siteorigin\_widget class=&#34;SiteOrigin\_Widget\_Image\_Widget&#34;\]\[/siteorigin\_widget\]&lt;p&gt;In this article, let me introduce you to the Customer Journey Map template I have designed. This template will simplify the data gathering and visualization of required data attributes such as your persona&amp;rsquo;s needs or motivations, important events, touchpoints, and actions. But first, let&amp;rsquo;s start with the definition.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;What is Customer Journey Mapping?&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;what-is-customer-journey-mapping&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#what-is-customer-journey-mapping&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Customer journey mapping is the process of creating a customer journey map, which is a &lt;strong&gt;visual representation of your customer’s or prospect’s interactions with your product.&lt;/strong&gt; This strategic exercise helps to think from customers’ or prospects’ perspectives and &lt;strong&gt;better understand their expectations, pain points, motivations, and needs. The journey map&lt;/strong&gt; maps out all touchpoints from the first to the final touchpoint for both your existing and potential customers and is leveraged to visualize and improve the overall customer onboarding and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;How to create a Customer Journey Map?&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;how-to-create-a-customer-journey-map&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#how-to-create-a-customer-journey-map&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Define primary and secondary personas for your product&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;A persona is a character profile or a fictional character. Personas help to understand the needs, experiences, behaviors, and goals of your users. If you want to create personas for your product, you may listen to my lecture in the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.udemy.com/course/agile-product-planning/?referralCode=09701186A5D469765D2B&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;online course&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Outline key events, persona&amp;rsquo;s needs, and possible interactions with your product across different traffic sources&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Create a comprehensive visual diagram that describes the journey of your primary and secondary personas&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;There are multiple visual tools that are available to create the journey diagram such as &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.mural.co/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Mural&lt;/a&gt;, Gliffy, &lt;a href=&#34;https://uxpressia.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;UXPressia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.lucidchart.com/pages/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Lucidchart&lt;/a&gt;, Microsoft Visio, OmniGraffle, &lt;a href=&#34;https://miro.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Miro&lt;/a&gt;, etc.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;For outlining the required data in Step#2, I created the Customer Journey Map Template or a Canvas as below:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Customer Journey Map Template for an Existing Customer&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;customer-journey-map-template-for-an-existing-customer&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#customer-journey-map-template-for-an-existing-customer&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;Customer Journey Mapping Canvas for an Existing Customer&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;2104&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;1048&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/images/Screen-Shot-2021-06-16-at-5.01.17-AM_hu_b7bcbaf7312aa996.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/images/Screen-Shot-2021-06-16-at-5.01.17-AM_hu_b7bcbaf7312aa996.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/images/Screen-Shot-2021-06-16-at-5.01.17-AM_hu_770f42d9df235781.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/images/Screen-Shot-2021-06-16-at-5.01.17-AM.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Enroll in the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.udemy.com/course/agile-product-planning/?referralCode=09701186A5D469765D2B&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;online course&lt;/a&gt; to download this canvas and learn more -&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.udemy.com/course/agile-product-planning/?referralCode=09701186A5D469765D2B&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Product Planning: Discovery, Vision, Strategy, Roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; - Create Business Models, Personas, Product Vision, Customer Journey Maps, Roadmap, and Product Backlog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Customer Journey Map Template for a Prospective Customer&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;customer-journey-map-template-for-a-prospective-customer&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#customer-journey-map-template-for-a-prospective-customer&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;1080&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;538&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/images/Screen-Shot-2021-06-16-at-5.09.41-AM_hu_dbde4f895e0bbd12.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/images/Screen-Shot-2021-06-16-at-5.09.41-AM_hu_dbde4f895e0bbd12.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/images/Screen-Shot-2021-06-16-at-5.09.41-AM.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/blog/2021/2021-06-13-customer-journey-mapping-template/images/Screen-Shot-2021-06-16-at-5.09.41-AM.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Enroll in the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.udemy.com/course/agile-product-planning/?referralCode=09701186A5D469765D2B&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;online course&lt;/a&gt; to download this canvas and learn more -&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.udemy.com/course/agile-product-planning/?referralCode=09701186A5D469765D2B&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Product Planning: Discovery, Vision, Strategy, Roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; - Create Business Models, Personas, Product Vision, Customer Journey Maps, Roadmap, and Product Backlog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3IzTwsi0P8M&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Watch the Customer Journey Mapping Lecture Here!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;watch-the-customer-journey-mapping-lecture-here&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#watch-the-customer-journey-mapping-lecture-here&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description>
      
